{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1564044-playing-fnaf-food-norms-advocates-federated","id":1564044,"title":"Playing FNAF - Food Norms Advocates Federated","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-09-14T09:03:08-07:00","id":1564044,"title":"Playing FNAF - Food Norms Advocates Federated","content":"Ok, the idea is crazy and other projects are priority, so I'll just throw here what I have for now.<br /> <br /> There's this restaurant hiring nightshift security, the job seems simple, trial contract five nights. It has animatronics and they'll activate autonomously. Dark magic shenanigans ensue and lots of possession.<br /> <br /> Food Norms Advocates Federated started as a single restaurant with six owners that offered each their own menu and was represented by a particular animatronic in the children's joint. It is now a franchise with seven brands, as each could launch their own and the joint venture still exists. The first place is now closed under pressure from disappearances and accidents.<br /> <br /> No one knows how they developed such fine robots, their technology being the most well guarded secret of the restaurants. It's also said that a curse lingers over them or some enemy sabotages their restaurants, given how tragedy follows a few of them.<br /> <br /> <u><b>REALITY:</b></u><br /> <br /> <b><i>How the owners built the Animatronics?</i></b><br /> <br /> R: They didn't. They are the animatronics, at least the original ones.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Are them evil masterminds?</b></i><br /> <br /> R: No, at least not much. They are monsters, but the interest in taking care of children is genuine.<br /> <br /> <i><b>What are those Animatronics?</b></i><br /> <br /> R: Members of six Main Splats from CoD that can somehow manifest as mechanical bodies or look the part.<br /> <br /> <i><b>So is this a tragic story about monsters trying to do good and failing?</b></i><br /> <br /> R: No, they're somewhat succeeding, actually, though not by much. They managed to protect quite some children thus far, things will get far worse if they falter.<br /> <br /> <i><b>What then is causing chaos and mayhem on the lives of the most innocent?</b></i><br /> <br /> R: The most wicked of them. A cabal of child infernalists is seeking power, dark experiments and to further the dominion of their masters.<br /> <br /> <i><b>How those infernal agents act?</b></i><br /> <br /> R: Varied resources to begin with, as they're the remaining 6 splats: 4 monsters, 1 Slasher with Hunter mechanics, and an accomplished blue book occultist built with material from Second Sight and Immortals, plus anything you want from splat books that's human facing.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Their methods?</b></i><br /> <br /> R: Mainly infiltration and sabotage. Sometimes children come to them restaurant with the evil touch of Hell within, or something to this effect. Some are pawns, some are innocent, some are suicidal zealots, some are monsters with a real chance of causing havoc and getting out.<br /> <br /> And that's it. Tweak, twist, enjoy. One day I'll get throw some more ideas, for now won't flesh it out much more. Don't take anything here as sacred, I won't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}